OL,3,GNEWSAHow do you move giraffes 180 miles
OL,4,Ato a new home?
OL,5,
OL,6,FKeep your neck, hooves and tail in the
OL,7,Fvehicle at all times.
OL,9,FZoo experts had the tall order of
OL,10,Ftransporting two female giraffes 180
OL,11,Fmiles (289.7km) on Tuesday to their new
OL,12,Fhome at Twycross Zoo, in
OL,13,FLeicestershire, from South Lakes Safari
OL,14,FZoo, in Cumbria, which closed its doors
OL,15,Fto the public in 2024.
OL,17,FEloise, 17, and 10-year-old Bonomanzi
OL,18,Fwere reunited with the rest of their
OL,19,Fherd - a family of three - at the zoo,
OL,20,Fwhich is home to the UK's only herd of
OL,21,FKordofan giraffes.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
