OL,3,GNEWSAHow do you move giraffes 180 miles
OL,4,Ato a new home?
OL,5,
OL,6,FYianna Cooling, the assistant curator
OL,7,Fof mammals at Twycross Zoo, said moving
OL,8,Fthe world's tallest animal was a "huge
OL,9,Fteam effort", and was delighted the
OL,10,Fcritically endangered species had
OL,11,Farrived safely.
